WEBVTT

00:00:01.289 --> 00:00:04.605
On the nineteenth of July,
Musgrave, Raynal and Alick

00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:06.430
sailed from Camp Cove.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:09.297
The gale caught them within
twenty miles of the island.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.181
Raynal and Alick took turns at the helm.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.156
Musgrave held a rope with one hand

00:00:17.156 --> 00:00:18.501
and pumped with the other.

